Arithmetic Operators:
Addition       = 13
Subtraction    = 7
Multiplication = 30
Division       = 3.3333333333333335
Modulus        = 1
Exponent       = 1000
Floor Division = 3

Relational Operators:
a == b : False
a != b : True
a > b  : True
a < b  : False
a >= b : True
a <= b : False

Logical Operators:
(a > 5 and b < 5) : True
(a > 15 or b < 5) : True
not(a > b)        : False

Bitwise Operators:
a & b = 2
a | b = 11
a ^ b = 9
~a    = -11
a << 1 = 20
a >> 1 = 5

Assignment Operators:
x = 10
x += 5 : 15
x -= 3 : 12
x *= 2 : 24
x /= 4 : 6.0